==Description==
''Deep with the {{Maguuma Jungle}} lies a tiny outpost surrounded by waterfalls.  So lovely and scenic is this place that adventurers often spend more time here than is strictly necessary to re-supply.  Situated as it is just outside {{Silverwood}}, {{Quarrel Falls}} is like the eye of the hurricane; a calm place to rest before the storm begins once again.''

==Getting there==
*Complete the {{Bloodstone Fen}} mission.
*Travel east from [[Druid's Overlook]] through [[Sage Lands]], then southeast through {{Mamnoon Lagoon}} and {{Silverwood}}. It's in the center of Silverwood.

