[[Image:Maguuma_lower.JPG|right|thumb|200px|Lower areas of the Maguuma Jungle]]
The Maguuma Jungle occupies much of the area west and southwest of [[Kryta]]. It is a thick jungle with gigantic trees and bursting flora and fauna. It is home to [[Jungle Troll]]s, [[Moss Scarab]]s, [[Centaur|Maguuma Centaur]]s and the rebel group, the [[Shining Blade]]. It is rumored that [[Saul D'Alessio]] first came in contact with the [[Unseen Ones]] in these jungles. 

There are two major types of terrain in the Maguuma.  The upper reaches are hot, dry, desert-like areas.  [[Devourer]]s, [[Thorn Stalker]]s, and [[Centaur|Maguuma Centaur]]s make their home in the upper parts.  The lower parts of the jungle are covered in plants, the middle altitudes still have dirt paths, while the lower areas are water filled.  [[Moss Scarab]]s, [[Storm Rider]]s, [[Jungle Troll]]s and the poisonous [[Maguuma Spider]]s, as well as some centaurs live here.  The waters of the [[Fount Of Maguuma]] have healing powers and will grant players a +1 [[health regeneration]].

