'''Dialogue:'''
:''歡迎你旅行者。不知道為什麼，見到挑戰{{Ascension}}的人類，讓我感到有些興奮。我雖然失敗了，但是希望你能夠通過這各考驗。啊，對了前不久我見過你的好友們。我跟他們說，到{{Skyward Reach}}的{{mesa}}看看。你最好也去一趟岩山，回來後告訴我你在旅途中所遇到的事情。我正在製作留給後人旅行者的見聞錄。

==Walkthrough==
Step outside (bring henchmen/your party too!), and just follow the {{Heroes of Ascalon}} ({{Devona}}, {{Cynn}} and {{Mhenlo}}) on the short walk to a nearby cliff that allows for a close view at the {{mesa}}. On the way there will be quite a few {{Hydra}}s, just kill them and move on. The leaders of the party walk quite slow and seem quite aggressive towards any Hydra they see. Also, they can get killed and it won't affect the outcome of your meeting on the top of the mesa.

