* {{Fawl Driftstalker}}, {{Signet of Judgment}}
* {{Didn Hopestealer}}, {{Illusionary Weaponry}}
* {{Featherclaw}}, {{Mantra of Recall}}
* {{Old Red Claw}}, {{Mind Shock}}
* {{Sala Chillbringer}}, {{Mist Form}}

