'''Dialogue'''
:歡迎！{{Yort the Bronze}}正在尋求幫助。他會提供你不錯的報酬，幫幫他吧。約特在{{Prophet's Path}}附近尋找{{Ceremonial Family Sword}}。不要問是怎樣發生的，那裡有許多半人馬與約特可怕的死亡糾纏在內，但他本人並不想詳談。 

:可以幫約特找回家族的寶劍嗎？

==Walkthrough==

Even though the sword is closest to {{The Amnoon Oasis}}, you cannot enter the valley where the sword is from the side of the Oasis. 

To start from Heroes' Audience, follow the purple path on the map. In the sand there will be {{Sand Elemental}}s and {{Minotaur}} and in the Oasis there will be {{Losaru}} groups. You will find some "Ancient Remains" (hold [Alt]) and in them there will be the {{Ceremonial Family Sword}}.

An easier way is to go from {{Augury Rock}} (the green path). Northwest from Augury is a teleporter. Go just East of the teleporter and you gain access to the canyon where the remains will be.

