All Merchants in the {{Echovald Forest}} offer the same set of goods as those in Kaineng City except that they offer {{Key|Kurzick Keys}} instead of Canthan Keys. {{Kurzick}} Merchants will not offer you their services if your {{Kurzick Faction}} is less than or equal to your {{Luxon Faction}}.

