All Merchants in {{the Jade Sea}} offer the same set of goods as those in Kaineng City except that they offer {{Key|Luxon Keys}} instead of Canthan Keys. {{Luxon}} Merchants will not offer you their services if your {{Luxon Faction}} is less than or equal to your {{Kurzick Faction}}.

