The {{Pockmark Flats}} are a large area south-east of Ascalon City. The northern part is a large crater with a giant {{Charr}} crystal in the middle with a lake of {{tar}} around it, and the southern part has a number of twisting paths with scattered ruins of a settlement of unknown name.

