'''Tip:''' A good place to start for solo adventures into the Pockmark Flats is the {{Serenity Temple}}. Right outside the exit you will find {{Devona}}. Talk to her (doubleclick her) and she will accompany you on your excursions as an ally. She is quite a powerful {{Warrior}} (more powerful than your henchman {{Stefan}}), so consider to take her with you whenever you explore the {{Pockmark Flats}} or the {{Eastern Frontier}}.

