{{BeastInfo  | name = Drake| image=[[image:Drake.jpg|128px]]| species = [[Drake (Species)|Drake]]| prof = [[Elementalist]]| icon = [[Image:Elementalist-icon.png]]| level = 24}}
:''This is an article about the individual creature type [[Drake]]. For information about the species Drake see: [[Drake (Species)]].''

==Description==
Drakes move faster than the normal player movement speed, so it is hard to outrun them. They are powerful Fire Elementalists, especially in close quarters combat their [[Flame Burst]] and [[Lava Font]] are not to be underestimated.

==Location==
*{{Ring of Fire Islands}}
**{{Perdition Rock}}
**{{火環群島 (任務)}}

==Skills==
*{{skill icon|Aura of Restoration}}
*{{skill icon|Elemental Attunement}}
*{{skill icon|Flame Burst}}
*{{skill icon|Lava Font}}
*{{skill icon|Mark of Rodgort}}

==Items Dropped==
*{{Fiery Crest}}

==Notes==
Drakes appear to have the ability to run several times the distance of the radar, to aid other Drakes that are in battle.

